The review has been written to `docs/reviews/der-catalog/dercat-03-battery-thermal-config.md`.

**Summary of findings**: 6 findings — 2 High, 2 Medium, 2 Low.

The two high-severity issues are:
1. **Tesla PW2 heater = 1500 W** (line 213) — would drain the 13.5 kWh battery in 9 hours with heater alone; likely a data-entry error for 150 W
2. **All 11 catalog products share identical lumped thermal mass (90 kJ/K) and UA (5.0 W/K)** — the Enphase IQ 5P gets 2.2× too much thermal inertia, the dual-PW3 gets 2.3× too little; neither the `BatterySpec` struct nor `to_config()` support per-product thermal parameters
